# This project does not package client API keys.
# Gemini requests go through Firebase AI Logic (see FirebaseGemini).
# Do not add GEMINI_API_KEY or any other credential here.
#
# Local Firebase config (gitignored): app/google-services.json
# Release signing environment variables:
#   KEYSTORE_PATH   absolute path to the upload keystore (alias must be "upload")
#   STORE_PASSWORD
#   KEY_PASSWORD
# Optional:
#   GITHUB_RUN_NUMBER   release versionCode (CI sets this)
#   VERSION_NAME        release versionName
